<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $64-7/8 (FIM 307.17).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $64-7/8 (FIM 307.17).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1-1/4 at $64-7/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 307.17 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed up 1.00 markka at 303.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) was untraded on Wall Street. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.70 markka at 80.30.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 0.90 markka at 94.90 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
